  "document": "Jamal Alioui\nJamal Alioui (Arabic: جمال عليوي‎ ‎ , born 2 June 1982) is a French-born Moroccan footballer. He currently plays for Wydad Casablanca. He also played for Perugia Calcio, Calcio Catania, F.C. Crotone, FC Metz, FC Sion, FC Nantes, Wydad Casablanca in the Moroccan league and Al-Kharitiyath in the Qatar Stars League."
